cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Event-grounded commentary taxonomy — method reproduction kit"
abstract: >-
  End-to-end implementation of the clustering and four-axis convergence
  validation protocol for thematic taxonomies of sports commentary. Ships a
  redistributable CC-BY iRacing corpus so the whole pipeline runs without
  access requests. Reproduces the method, not the numbers of the associated
  paper, which analysed a broadcast-copyright Formula 1 corpus that cannot be
  redistributed.
type: software
